  "gotchas": [
    "Write settings through Option_Center::save_settings(), not update_option(), so field sanitization and rewrite/htaccess side effects run.",
    "rank_math_robots is an array; noindex/nofollow are entries, not boolean flags.",
    "Per-post-type keys are dynamic (pt_{post_type}_title) and only exist after the post type is registered.",
    "Meta writes use the rank_math_* prefix for posts, terms and users; there is no separate term option."
